      "type": "NoteNode",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 640,
      "init": {
        "label": "B \u00b7 Comparison \u2192 real TRUE/FALSE",
        "body": "`5 > 3` emits a real **logical** (purple socket), shown **TRUE** \u2014 not 1. Into \u00d710 it coerces to 1/0 \u2192 **10** (the multiply-by-a-condition trick still works). **AND** also emits a logical; its `b=1` coerces the other way (number \u2192 TRUE).",
        "color": "purple",
        "width": 230,
        "height": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "type": "NumberInputNode",
      "x": 230,
      "y": 660,
      "init": {
        "label": "5",
        "value": 5
