      "x": -40,
      "y": 2300,
      "init": {
        "label": "F \u00b7 Kleene logic + Filter on missing data",
        "body": "Reuses the null-bearing `vals` from A. **`> 2`** per element \u2192 `FALSE, null, FALSE, TRUE` \u2014 a comparison with a missing value is **unknown**, not FALSE (Kleene). **Filter `> 1`** drops the unknown row (SQL WHERE keeps only TRUE) \u2192 `3, 4`.",
